        "text": "A stooping sized entrance slopes down the right and quickly chokes in smaller grovels. There appears to be no or little draught. A small extension was excavated in 2007 and the cave was thoroughly examined, pushed and surveyed to a length of 41m (from 29m) in the summer, 2023."
      }
    ],
